    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Heba",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110655273574055170800/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJU-THQeJ66JGEnJK7EUAB6YWFPnD7DY0dolOK_xGuLJtT6Tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I went to this store multiple times but today would be the last time I would ever step foot in it. I first entered the store, no greetings, which is OK because they were busy I guess. I went to look for a specific shoe I had in mind. I went to an employee to ask for help, she just pointed at the shoe, not offering to help or anything. I stayed there trying to look for my size until a RUDE lady with black straight hair (which I think was the manager) came up to me, reacted weirdly to my questions. I felt very judged, and it’s not the first time I get a bad impression from this specific lady. She answered my questions rudely AND didn’t pay much attention to me. I was still talking when she proceeded to go and talk to someone else.",
        "time": 1757267453,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111758365305340541839/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsYsipnd87Y5cdOSFBjexlpdBKckUrAofpgS8U9mpV8o6llw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "1. I was charged for the membership without ever being told there was a charge for it, plus it wasn’t even beneficial for me to get the membership and the assistant manager knew very well that I would be returning at least one pair of shoes, possibly both, depending on which model was preferred and whether they fit. They refuse to refund the membership charge and I have been emailing for almost 3 weeks now to try and get this resolved.\n2. Last time I was there, July 26 2025, the assistant manager was firing an employee right next to the cash register, in front of me!!! I can’t begin to imagine how that poor employee felt! I know it made ME feel HORRIBLE.\nUpdate: July31st: their reply to this review is to contact them at the very same email I’ve been using, with NO RESPONSE 🙄🤦‍♀️ Update2: Beginning of August I called my credit card to get the membership fee refunded. From what I understand, Rubino gaslit M/C by showing them a credit done for a shoe refund, passing it for the membership fee refund. Either that, or they made a mistake, or are incompetent, or M/C is incompetent. Now I have to contact M/C once again 🙄",
        "time": 1756297366,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "alexia dorazio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106035261226440413690/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL2QYcxhhYXOvOhFr0UaiR7UOs1cmwQ80LWKCAoi5M2VzKUAA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Bought these shoes at Rubino on Saturday amazing service, employees were very nice and helpful. Thank you I’ll definitely be coming back",
        "time": 1757467293,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alex AB",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117424046444149891491/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjeYum9tHCr2VrS-fuHCLgr50ybCWEcAupF7HMQF7pQPJvYfQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had a very unpleasant experience at this shoe store. The customer service is extremely poor, and the way the staff is treated is even worse. I witnessed a disturbing scene where a female manager with black hair was yelling at employees in front of customers. This kind of behavior is completely unacceptable and creates a very uncomfortable atmosphere.\n\nWhat’s even more disappointing is that the store management does nothing to stop this. If this is how they allow their employees to be treated, it says a lot about their values. It makes you not want to come back or even step inside the store again. I definitely do not recommend this place.",
        "time": 1753560730,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luca",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111563407407231937130/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOUrp3xjmsGYQg5SmFU2jYQy_1o_xeuPJcitnCS7uwwzp70rV4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Not sure what store people are going to but I had a great experience, as I walked in I was greeted with smiles they gave me time to look around then proceeded to help me as well as being very polite and patient, definitely will be returning to the store.",
        "time": 1757467453,
        "translated": false
